Package: SGCB
Type: Package
Title: Shallow Generalized-Gamma Calibrated Bootstrap for Bulk RNA-seq DE Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Developer", "Name", , "dev@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A differential expression analysis method for bulk RNA-seq
    using Generalized Gamma (GG) distribution modeling with information-geometric
    natural gradient optimization. Features include: hierarchical Bayesian GG
    parameter estimation with Firth penalty, limma-style empirical Bayes variance
    shrinkage informed by GG theoretical variance, manifold distance Wald test
    for differential distribution detection, Cauchy-combined omnibus scoring,
    and optional calibrated bootstrap confidence intervals.
